@ColinZ22 All in all after rebasing, the `GPQA` accuracy tests "fse vs non-fse" look stable and the deviations are within noise and sampling effect.
Moreover I have noticed that in the CI e2e test, the `run_eval` is used for `gsm8k`, so I have mimicked this CI test and it is fine and reported above. 
I have added more feature tests and opened this PR.

